    "Brighter days carried around %@ steps; dimmer ones around %@ — %@." : {
      "comment" : "Stats tab, Body & Mood card: line under the finding's title, giving the numbers. 'Brighter' and 'dimmer' days are days whose entries read more or less positive. About 100 characters. The last placeholder is the phrase 'across N days'. First and second placeholders: average step counts, already formatted with the locale's grouping.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
