    "Morning rhythm (HRV) averaged %lld ms on brighter days and %lld ms on dimmer ones — %@." : {
      "comment" : "Stats tab, Body & Mood card: line under the finding's title, giving the numbers. 'Brighter' and 'dimmer' days are days whose entries read more or less positive. About 100 characters. The last placeholder is the phrase 'across N days'. First and second placeholders: average morning heart rate variability in milliseconds. HRV and ms are the abbreviations Apple Health uses.",
