    "OF 0:42 · %lld TICKS LIT" : {
      "comment" : "Recording dial (full screen while speaking): counter under the dial: how many of the 42 ticks around the dial are lit (0, or 2 to 42), one per second spoken. Upper case, monospaced, about 22 characters. Keep 0:42 as it is: the 42-second ritual is a soft target, not a limit.",
