    "Ready — it knows your body's rhythms from %@ kept moments." : {
      "comment" : "Twin tab, Body Twin card: status line under the card title. About 60 characters. Body Twin has learned enough; the placeholder is how many Health signals the user kept. The number arrives as digits in a string placeholder, exactly as the English has always printed it (never grouped), so the catalog cannot vary it by count: phrase it so one form reads right for every count.",
