    "%@s run high." : {
      "comment" : "Twin tab, Patterns: bold first line of a finding about the user's mood. Short, about 30 characters. Entries on this weekday read higher than usual. The placeholder is a weekday name from the calendar ('Monday'); the English adds 's' to make it plural, so rephrase freely ('On Mondays…').",
