    "Slept %@ — your sky is clear." : {
      "comment" : "Today tab: Body Twin whisper, one calm line with an icon above the day's question. Never clinical. About 50 characters. Shown after 7 hours of sleep or more. The placeholder is the sleep length, such as '7h 45m' or '8h'. 'Sky' is the app's metaphor for the journal.",
