    "I kept %@ stars." : {
      "comment" : "Share card image (Gift a star), drawn on a 1080px square and posted publicly. Headline, line 1 of 2, first person: the user is inviting a friend. The placeholder is the number of entries (stars). Display face, about 18 characters. The number arrives as digits in a string placeholder, exactly as the English has always printed it (never grouped), so the catalog cannot vary it by count: phrase it so one form reads right for every count.",
