    "No forms, no sign-up. Just talk about\nyour day — and watch your voice become\nthe first star in a sky only you can see." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding, invite screen: line under the headline, on three centred lines; the line breaks are for balance and can move. About 115 characters.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keine Formulare, keine Anmeldung. Erzähl einfach von\ndeinem Tag – und sieh, wie deine Stimme zum\nersten Stern an einem Himmel wird, den nur du siehst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sin formularios, sin registro. Solo habla de\ntu día y mira cómo tu voz se convierte en\nla primera estrella de un cielo que solo tú ves."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Aucun formulaire, aucune inscription. Parle simplement de\nta journée — et regarde ta voix devenir\nla première étoile d'un ciel rien qu'à toi."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Niente moduli, niente registrazione. Parla della\ntua giornata e guarda la tua voce diventare\nla prima stella di un cielo che solo tu puoi vedere."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Sem formulários, sem cadastro. Só fale sobre\nseu dia — e veja sua voz virar\na primeira estrela de um céu que só você vê."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No mood" : {
      "comment" : "Mood picker and entry detail: the choice that clears the mood. About 12 characters.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
