    "Your brighter days followed about %@h of sleep; dimmer ones about %@h — %@." : {
      "comment" : "Stats tab, Body & Mood card: line under the finding's title, giving the numbers. 'Brighter' and 'dimmer' days are days whose entries read more or less positive. About 100 characters. The last placeholder is the phrase 'across N days'. First and second placeholders: average hours of sleep with one decimal, already formatted for the locale. 'h' abbreviates hours.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Deinen helleren Tagen gingen etwa %1$@ Std. Schlaf voraus, dunkleren etwa %2$@ Std. – %3$@."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your brighter days followed about %1$@h of sleep; dimmer ones about %2$@h — %3$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Tus días más luminosos siguieron a unas %1$@ h de sueño; los más apagados, a unas %2$@ h, %3$@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Tes jours plus lumineux suivaient environ %1$@ h de sommeil ; les plus sombres, environ %2$@ h — %3$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "I tuoi giorni più luminosi seguivano circa %1$@ h di sonno; quelli più spenti circa %2$@ h, %3$@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Seus dias mais luminosos vieram depois de cerca de %1$@h de sono; os mais apagados, cerca de %2$@h — %3$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your calm baseline, not your peaks" : {
